{"about_the_game":"<strong>ATTENTION!!! WE ARE CURRENTLY IN THE PROCESS OF CHANGING THIS GAME TO BE FREE TO PLAY. DO NOT BUY IT FOR MONEY. WAIT FOR IT TO BE FREE!</strong> <i>This game is a few years old and might not be the best experience with modern VR hardware. Its gameplay and principles are based on a very different set or devices and might not be much fun today.</i><br><br>Like racing trough endless tunnels in space? Then look no further, this is the game for you. Because it is all about racing. In a tunnel. In space. Sounds great? Yes it does! Tunnel VR is a procedural racing game.<br>But the fun does not stop there. Periodically the tunnel changes and you will fly through venes and even a pizza tunnel. Made you hungry for the game? Good!<br><br>Features:<br><br>Endless Tunnel Fun!<br>Are on a diet? Get your share of pizza in the pizzatunnel!<br>See what fat does to your venes in the blood vessel tunnel!<br>Play it in VR or with the mouse (but heroes play in VR)!<br>Steam achievements to show of your tunnelskills!<br>Three unique peices of music!<br>The faster you go the more instruments will play because we couldn't afford to have them play the whole time!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"db486c0f7b6aea272d08e5b6911ad0c61c1978b1.jpg","localized_name":"Music Enthusiast","name":"Music Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/533740/db486c0f7b6aea272d08e5b6911ad0c61c1978b1.jpg"},{"icon":"576cdd56b3c320885322907e04120044a8fa09d4.jpg","localized_name":"Training Wheels ","name":"Training Wheels ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/533740/576cdd56b3c320885322907e04120044a8fa09d4.jpg"},{"icon":"c0e912a469827a9269ed98cc1750c97fe2b94640.jpg","localized_name":"Not hitting the walls","name":"Not hitting the walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/533740/c0e912a469827a9269ed98cc1750c97fe2b94640.jpg"},{"icon":"fbe8d30290a83e22032f2